    "disclosures": [
      "No primary source publishes a qualifiable 46630 route: the Robinhood /rhj/assets registry lists zero 46630 deployments, Chainlink lists no Robinhood testnet feeds, and Morpho lists only the Robinhood mainnet deployment.",
      "Collateral is the faucet TSLA test token; its uid() differs from the issuer registry TSLA asset ID, so it is not a registered Robinhood Stock Token.",
      "The market oracle VigilOracle reads a MockFeed whose set() and setAt() are callable by anyone: any account can move the price, liquidate the position, or make price() revert as stale.",
      "The market IRM is MockIRM with a fixed per-second rate, not AdaptiveCurveIrm.",
      "The vault is idle-only (no liquidity adapter) with zero timelock: its owner/curator can change adapters, caps, or gates instantly; idle USDG earns no yield, so no APY or carry claim is made.",
      "Test USDG and test TSLA have no monetary value."
    ]
  },
